  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgS2eFF5xMBFWTlu9fJ1vPtdca-7LRjiiGjN6_axsRmD3LiwwBZgAfFZi7-qq9M8bhmhe19QEPeJnWVkXTMKYSCvvMFGS8H1mS3hTCk9RB6C7rWNT9msgrLXRFKBI40978FEKmM-6jrer9el4ov2Cjga76B0MUE0uNnZMCnHkLgHR_EeXucdpD73q6Iujg/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-12-16T174748.489.jpeg\"><img alt=\"מלך נבוך מוקף ביועציו &quot;החכמים&quot;\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgS2eFF5xMBFWTlu9fJ1vPtdca-7LRjiiGjN6_axsRmD3LiwwBZgAfFZi7-qq9M8bhmhe19QEPeJnWVkXTMKYSCvvMFGS8H1mS3hTCk9RB6C7rWNT9msgrLXRFKBI40978FEKmM-6jrer9el4ov2Cjga76B0MUE0uNnZMCnHkLgHR_EeXucdpD73q6Iujg/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-12-16T174748.489.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">עם עצות - אני מסודר!</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַיִּקְרָא אֶת כָּל חַרְטֻמֵּי מִצְרַיִם וְאֶת כָּל חֲכָמֶיהָ</span></blockquote></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">מֵאָז וּמֵעוֹלָם,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">נוֹעֲצוּ הַמּוֹשְׁלִים.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">בְּגָלוּי וּבַנֶּעֱלָם,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">בְּיוֹעֲצֵי חֳרָשִׁים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">פַּעַם, נִקְרְאוּ 'חַרְטֻמִּים',<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אוּלַי בִּגְלַל הַכְּתָב 😊<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אוֹ בִּגְלַל הַחוֹטְמִים 👃<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">שֶׁדּוֹחֲפִים עַד עַכְשָׁו.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">הָאֶחָד, יוֹעֵץ מְדִינִי,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וְגַם יוֹעֵץ סְתָרִים.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">חֲבֵרוֹ, יוֹעֵץ מִקְצוֹעִי,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְעִנְיְנֵי מִגְזָר וּמִעוּטִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֲצֵי אַצּוֹת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֲצֵי AI.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">בְּמִפְגְּשֵׁי חֲצוֹת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יַגִּידוּ מָה כְּדַאי.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">מֻמְחֵי תִּקְשֹׁרֶת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וּרְשָׁתוֹת חֶבְרָתִיּוֹת.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">בְּנֵי תִּשְׁחֹרֶת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">מְהַנְדְּסֵי תּוֹדָעוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">הוֹי שַׁלִּיט דָּגוּל,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">זְרֹק אֵיזֶה סְפִּין.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">תָּמִיד תִּצֹּר בִּדּוּל,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">בֵּין אֻכְלוּסִין.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">תִּצְטַלֵּם בִּמְעִיל צְבָאִי,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">רַק לֹא בְּיוֹם מְעֻנָּן.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">תְּשַׁדֵּר מַרְאֶה מִבְצָעִי,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">תָּמִיד דָּרוּךְ - מוּכָן.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אַל תַּפְסִיק לְטַרְטֵר,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אֶת הַיּוֹעֵץ הַמִּשְׁפָּטִי.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">בְּעֶצֶם, עָדִיף לְפַטֵּר,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">הוּא כָּל כָּךְ לְעֻמָּתִי.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">***</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אַךְ מָה שֶׁהָיָה פַּעַם,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">שָׁמוּר רַק לַמֶּלֶךְ.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">פָּרַץ מִפְּקַק הַשַּׁעַם,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וּמֻצָּע&nbsp;</span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְ</span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">כָּל הֵלֶךְ.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\"><span>כִּי בַּשָּׁנִים הָאַחֲרוֹנוֹת,<br /></span></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">נִפְרַץ לוֹ הַפָּרֶץ.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וְעֵצוֹת וְהַצָּעוֹת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">מָלְאוּ אֶת הָאָרֶץ.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">תִּמְכֹּר אַגַ\"ח בִּירִידָה,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">תִּקְנֶה תְּעוּדוֹת סַל.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וּכְשֶׁהַשּׁוּק בָּעֲלִיָּה,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אַל תִּכָּנֵס בִּכְלָל.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">עֵצוֹת בִּמְחִיר&nbsp;</span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\"><span>הֶצַּע,</span></span><br /><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְכָל יוֹם - לְכָל שָׁעָה.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">עֵצוֹת פֶּר תּוֹצָאָה,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">הֲגוּנָה אוֹ מְגֻנָּה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֲצֵי נִשּׂוּאִין,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְכָל הַזּוּגוֹת.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֲצֵי עֲצִיצִים,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְגִדּוּל בַּגִּנּוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֲצֵי אִטּוּם,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וְיִעוּץ גֵּנֵטִי.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֲצֵי גִּזּוּם,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וְשִׁמּוּר אֵנֶרְגֵּטִי.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">כָּל אֵם דּוֹרֶשֶׁת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֶצֶת הֲנָקָה.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">כָּ</span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">ל פָּעוֹטָה רוֹעֶשֶׁת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">יוֹעֶצֶת אֲנָקָה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">***</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">רַק שֶׁמֵּרֹב עֵצוֹת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לֹא רוֹאִים אֶת הַיַּעַר.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וּמִבְּלִיל הַהַצָּעוֹת,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אַתָּה חָשׁ כְּבַּעַר.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">וְלָכֵן רַבּוֹתַי,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">אֶתֵּן לָכֶם הֲצָצָה.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְ</span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">מָּה שֶׁיִּהְיֶה, יְדִידַי,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">הַתְּחוּם הַחַם הַבָּא.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">הֵירָשְׁמוּ מִיָּד לְלִמּוּדִים,<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">לְ</span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">מִּקְצוֹעַ מֵהַנּוֹצְצִים.<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\">'מֻמְחֶה לְהַתְאָמַת יִיעוּצִים',<br /></span></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color: #222222;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">בְּכָל הָעֲרוּצִים</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\">.</span></span></span></p>"
}
